  "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype: Oppression of Women",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslim women are oppressed or vulnerable to violence, which is a common trope in Islamophobic discourse. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the metaphorical meaning of the cat (representing a Muslim man) questioning whether the butterfly (representing a Muslim woman) is a 'punching bag'.",
